,2011,51,124,26],[18112,18.6,2011,46,123,25]],"links":[["Deaf Smith County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/texas/deaf-smith-county"],["ARC or PLC in Deaf Smith County","/arc-plc/texas/deaf-smith-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 44 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids. In 2025, April to May ran 194% of normal there, and February to March ran 28%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 3% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid listed had its driest year in 2011, with grid 17509 at 45%.</p>"}
